{"factor": "investment_of_money", "name": "投资资金", "name_en": "Investment of Money", "question": "参与者是否投入了资金、资产、劳务或其他对价以获取代币？", "indicators": [{"pattern": "购买", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "认购", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "出资", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "投资", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "purchase", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "buy", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "invest", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "contribute", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "ico", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "ieo", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "兑换", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "swap", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "质押", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "stake", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "staking", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "锁仓", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "lock", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "空投", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "airdrop", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "免费", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "free", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "赠予", "weight": "absent"}], "notes": "Howey 本身要求‘金钱出资’，但后续判例（如 SEC v. Joiner、形成判例的 Tyler 等）将‘出资’扩展至以劳务/其他对价换取权益的情形。空投若无需任何对价通常不构成出资；但若空投附带锁仓并承诺收益，可能被重新审视。", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/corpfin/framework-investment-contract-analysis-digital-assets", "source_accessed_at": "2026-09-17"}
{"factor": "common_enterprise", "name": "共同企业", "name_en": "Common Enterprise", "question": "是否存在投资者与发起人（或投资者之间）的共同利益，使投资者的收益与整体事业捆绑？", "indicators": [{"pattern": "资金池", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "pool", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "收益分配", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "分红池", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "commingled", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "按比例分配", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "生态", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "ecosystem", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "网络效应", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "持币即参与", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "独立使用", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "independent use", "weight": "absent"}], "notes": "共同企业在巡回法院中有三种测试：横向共同性（投资者间）、纵向共同性（投资者与发起人）、广泛共同性。多数联邦法院采纵向共同性。若代币收益完全取决于持有者个人对代币的使用而非整体事业表现，通常否定共同企业。", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/corpfin/framework-investment-contract-analysis-digital-assets", "source_accessed_at": "2026-09-17"}
{"factor": "expectation_of_profits", "name": "利润预期", "name_en": "Expectation of Profits", "question": "购买者是否有理由期待通过代币的升值或分配获得收益（而非仅获得使用价值）？", "indicators": [{"pattern": "收益", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "利润", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "年化", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "apy", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "分红", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "股息", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "dividend", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "升值", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "增值", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "appreciation", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "回报", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "yield", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "回报预期", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "潜在价值", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "可能上涨", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "potential upside", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "仅用于支付", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "无收益承诺", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "no profit", "weight": "absent"}], "notes": "SEC 关注‘合理的利润预期’。营销话术（如‘持币待涨’‘分红预期’）是关键证据。若代币仅用于购买平台内服务且无二级市场炒作叙事，通常难证成利润预期。", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/corpfin/framework-investment-contract-analysis-digital-assets", "source_accessed_at": "2026-09-17"}
{"factor": "efforts_of_others", "name": "依赖他人努力", "name_en": "Efforts of Others", "question": "代币价值或收益是否主要依赖发起人、创始团队或第三方的持续努力（而非去中心化自执行机制）？", "indicators": [{"pattern": "团队开发", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "创始人", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "持续运营", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "路线图", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "roadmap", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "基金会管理", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "核心团队", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "ongoing development", "weight": "strong"}, {"pattern": "部分去中心化", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "社区治理", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "community governance", "weight": "weak"}, {"pattern": "完全去中心化", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "自执行", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "smart contract", "weight": "absent"}, {"pattern": "无需团队", "weight": "absent"}], "notes": "第四要素要求收益‘主要（solely）来自’他人努力。SEC 框架强调：若网络已‘充分去中心化’且代币功能不依赖某一方持续努力，可否定本要素。这是许多‘功能型/治理型’代币抗辩的核心。", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/corpfin/framework-investment-contract-analysis-digital-assets", "source_accessed_at": "2026-09-17"}
